{"generated": "2026-07-27 03:14", "curation": {"market": "개인 투자자 여러분, 안녕하십니까. 지난 24시간 주요 시장 뉴스를 분석하여 투자에 도움이 될 만한 핵심 테마를 브리핑해 드립니다.\n\n<b>1. 글로벌 통화 시장의 복잡한 움직임과 환율 변동성 확대</b>\n최근 원화 환율은 일시적으로 하락했지만, 실질 가치는 17년 3개월 만에 최저치를 기록하는 등 불안정한 모습을 보이고 있습니다. 엔화의 추락과 원화 강세가 뚜렷한 디커플링 현상을 보이며, 유가 상승과 중동 전쟁 리스크가 원·달러 환율을 1400원대 중후반으로 끌어올릴 수 있다는 전망이 나옵니다. [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE5kWkpYQk44RjgtSDliT0hlcEF2UThJMVQ2azcxenlhRUZ2aC1wd2owNHczb2doVTNfUXRUNk1tdFFqTlNhQWc0M25YUlh4eUk?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#1</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE9oeW5OWTUxNnNLeFVVSmlRblg1djdkclpfYlRsQ2FFMEhvNFNZb05hVUhpazZxWV9hWFhTRDRVV01TcENRRWUxX0RQbm1XcXBrME1Kb3pSbHF4dERTMFlycnNyNlNsLWFxTFpxQVVKeGttTnB2?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#12</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE0wQl9WUHFuYWtiZ2NvZ2M3RmZrUEZpc0U3a1JBaUYwRFJaQk5MckNVU1pyQk1FcFhvRjVOYXVySkJ1UHkwbTJiTWR6SFZuTmZqNF8tQmZ4TGtqUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1jN3JZeWp6MlRuY0h3U1ZiV3d1UFcyTlJBTEJSRFhtbU01THoxb3hjSXBMUC10ZmdXNV91Z2NvM3VZamtnZW5JNXdNVFdlT29q?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#15</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE5EUzJSNzliOW5seTdHQnJZSElRMExKLTliU2RoazBDTW9EVWhZUXdLY2MteTljZHRlcXlXZ09waTRhZjZYWEd3YTdmYklJX3EzRFZTQm1Qd1NOQdIBX0FVX3lxTFBHVERSTU91bkthWmM1QXBKR1pWT013bEFucldJbThXdTJCeGREYk94bHhfMG1KSlpPOC12Ymp2bC04amMyMmY5QXp0OVBSaC1Ra0RiWktXYURvT0pfOXl3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5iX1VNYmpXZmNpalVyeWQtYk9CcXBOR1dFRHBQOURXQUdrbFdaQkhCc0hpWWtaTl94YjZaQXdMS2tBSThjMzZfZF9BZ2preldsc1dydFMtOFo2UG9Db2IyYWhzMFhWMFk?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE9XOWpranoxU1ItNEhHRDM3NFpjZkZFaDZFM3o1TDVsOHZGTkJtQUxYbFplMFJGaG9CRHVRSlYycjNvZ0oxLTk5eDRpZTdpRmsxWm1